{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GUIDE THE UNITED HUMANOID RACES TO VICTORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a space fleet commander, you take control of a powerful armada. Lead your ships to victory through skillful strategic action. Conquer planets to further enhance your strength.  <br><strong> </strong> <br><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE\u200b</strong>   <br>Craft your own gameplay style by combining active and passive abilities. A multitude of builds is possible, each catering to individual tastes. Whether defensive or offensive, cunning or economical \u2014 there are no limits to the variety of playstyles.  <br>  <br><strong>CHALLENGE YOURSELF FOR GLORY AND HONOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose mutators for your opponent to experience a special challenge. Increase your rewards and complete missions with special honors. For honor!  <br>  <br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced, node-based strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Individual builds and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 missions (10 demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mutator and honor system for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awesome soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For casual and hardcore players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691360?t=1745449226","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691360?t=1745449226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691360/b5d8a8272f6dd8e9986334d8c1d7cc06d74087f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745449226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691360/b5d8a8272f6dd8e9986334d8c1d7cc